I am finally in my flat.
I am very hungry.
I go into the kitchen and cook the pasta.
I also make a sauce with the vegetables from the supermarket.
Dinner is ready quickly.
I sit at the kitchen table and eat.
The food tastes very good.
My phone is lying on the table.
I look at the screen and smile.
I have a message from my sister Sofia.
Sofia lives with our parents in Mexico.
There it is now morning.
The message is long and very funny.
Sofia writes a story about our dog Lola.
I read the message carefully.
I laugh out loud.
Then I write a reply.
The long day is now at an end.
I drink another glass of water and relax.
